---
// Minimal editorial hero: left-aligned oversized headline with an email capture form and fine print.
---

<section class="border-b border-line bg-bg py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="h-px w-10 bg-brand-600"></span>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-muted">Project planning for teams of 2 to 50</p>
    </div>

    <h1 class="mt-8 max-w-5xl font-display text-6xl leading-none font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance text-fg sm:text-7xl lg:text-8xl">Work at the pace of thinking, not pinging.</h1>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
      <p class="max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-pretty text-muted sm:text-xl">Halcyon is a quieter way to run projects. Write the plan once, see progress without asking, and let everyone get back to the work they were hired to do.</p>

      <div>
        <form action="#" method="post" class="flex max-w-md flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <label for="hero4-email" class="sr-only">Work email</label>
          <input id="hero4-email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@company.com" class="w-full min-w-0 flex-1 rounded-button border border-line bg-bg px-5 py-3 text-base text-fg placeholder:text-muted focus:border-brand-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500/30 focus:outline-none" />
          <button type="submit" class="shrink-0 rounded-button bg-brand-600 px-6 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-sm shadow-brand-600/25 transition-colors hover:bg-brand-700 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-brand-500">Get early access</button>
        </form>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-md text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Free for 14 days, then free forever for teams of five or fewer. We will only email you about your account.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
